For every part below, check that the pinned LCSC part's "value" matches the
"wanted_value" the circuit asked for (resistance, capacitance, voltage rating,
package). A design assertion checks the declared value, not the pinned part,
so a wrong LCSC id ships silently.

{{ ref('parts') | tojson(indent=2) }}

Fail if any part's value differs from its wanted_value and "mismatch" is null.
Reply with only valid JSON: {"results": "pass"} or {"results": "fail"}.
